{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"天氣報告｜大致天晴　本周後期早晚清涼\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/OBS-FORECAST-261115-07.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】廣東沿岸風勢微弱，天色大致良好。本港地區今日(11月15日)天氣預測，大致天晴。日間乾燥，最高氣溫約27度。吹輕微至和緩北至東北風。</p><p>展望未來一兩日雲量較多，但明日風勢較大。星期三北風增強，稍後氣溫顯著下降。本周後期早晚普遍清涼。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T23:52:48.767091+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":123,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T23:04:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T07:51:27.586595+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T23:46:17.995953+00:00","content_hash":"e4dab927e2a63f3b8a93f5f7ce5963506b7041462aebe961a454e9f85fe8bcbe","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}